#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:5 19157b21681f4a0e85dc506f98f84805
msgid "ROS and Hector SLAM for Non-GPS Navigation"
msgstr "使用 ROS 和 Hector SLAM 实现非 GPS 导航"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:7 c55464c5cf6e48ee8c8b35b30c6fa920
msgid ""
"This page shows how to setup ROS and `Hector SLAM "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/hector_slam>`__ using an `RPLidarA2 lidar "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/rplidar>`__ to provided a local position estimate for "
"ArduPilot so that it can operate without a GPS."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍如何配置 ROS 和 `Hector SLAM <http://wiki.ros.org/hector_slam>`__，使用 "
"`RPLidarA2 激光雷达 <http://wiki.ros.org/rplidar>`__ 为 ArduPilot 提供本地位置估计，从而实现无 "
"GPS 操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:9 80edfa548d3044238568f3e43b23be7a
msgid ""
"These instructions were tested on an :ref:`NVidia TX2 <companion-computer-"
"nvidia-tx2>` flashed with :ref:`APSync <apsync-intro>` and then ROS and "
"MAVROS were :ref:`installed as described here <ros-install>`."
msgstr ""
"这些说明在刷入 :ref:`APSync <apsync-intro>` 的 :ref:`NVidia TX2 <companion-computer-"
"nvidia-tx2>` 上测试，然后按 :ref:`此处说明 <ros-install>` 安装 ROS 和 MAVROS。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:11 da84ef2e9be442cfb03ba589f8d787e0
msgid ""
"They were also tested on an :ref:`RaspberryPi 3 B+ <raspberry-pi-via-"
"mavlink>` with ROS and MAVROS installed :ref:`installed as described here "
"<ros-install>`."
msgstr ""
"这些说明也在安装了 ROS 和 MAVROS（按 :ref:`此处说明 <ros-install>` 安装）的 :ref:`树莓派 3 B+ "
"<raspberry-pi-via-mavlink>` 上测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:15 306aa23f48e34ebcb2db63c8f53e395b
msgid "these pages are a work-in-progress"
msgstr "这些页面仍在持续完善中"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:18 f1022415a8a44857b1da9f680967df98
msgid "Mounting the RPLidar and Pixhawk"
msgstr "安装 RPLidar 和 Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:23 d96e6b20fb464bab9b09b82543bb65c7
msgid ""
"The RPLidar should be oriented so that its USB cable wire is pointing "
"forward in the same direction as the arrow on the flight controller."
msgstr "RPLidar 应朝向与飞控箭头相同的正前方，即 USB 线朝前。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:25 ae165c4903254f42a7b4bf6963b4d75d
msgid ""
"The USB cable should be plugged into a USB port on the companion computer "
"running ROS."
msgstr "USB 线应插入运行 ROS 的伴飞计算机的 USB 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:28 36c9e9fb4cfd475ba03ee778616b40a2
msgid "Check the RPLidar's serial port"
msgstr "检查 RPLidar 的串口"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:30 11723397b34a4ee0bd33c123b262bb6f
msgid ""
"plug the RPLidarA2 into the companion computer.  If using a TX2 mounted on "
"an AUVidea J120 board, ensure the lidar is plugged into the lower USB port."
msgstr "将 RPLidarA2 插入伴飞计算机。若 TX2 安装在 AUVidea J120 板上，请确保激光雷达插入下方 USB 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:36 59356ef0938c4313b0abe5b1803d1acc
msgid "the lidar should appear as /dev/ttyUSB0 or /dev/ttyACM0."
msgstr "激光雷达应出现为 /dev/ttyUSB0 或 /dev/ttyACM0。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:37 75cf68c5a9b54f148a50515d954aabb2
msgid ""
"if you type \"lsusb\" the device should also be listed as \"Cygnal "
"Integrated Products, Inc. CP210x UART Bridge / myAVR mySmartUSB light\""
msgstr ""
"输入「lsusb」时，设备应显示为「Cygnal Integrated Products, Inc. CP210x UART Bridge / "
"myAVR mySmartUSB light」"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:38 6d0ca91945224bdea6241411887d77a0
msgid ""
"allow anyone to read from the device by entering just one of the following "
"two commands depending upon which serial port was found above"
msgstr "根据上面找到的串口，输入以下两条命令之一，允许任何用户读取该设备"

