#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:165 d6503515668d42cd9db5e080e6ba6949
msgid "Configure ArduPilot"
msgstr "配置 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:167 f17ecea387a44ff6b266b5a88b0b121b
msgid ""
"Connect to the flight controller with a ground station (i.e. Mission "
"Planner) and check that the following parameters are set as shown below:"
msgstr "使用地面站（如 Mission Planner）连接飞行控制器，并确认以下参数按如下设置："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:169 8e3a171ca9694184ae275eb574e7caad
msgid ""
":ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <copter:AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` = 2 (the default) to use EKF2 "
"(at the time this page was written the EKF3 did not yet support external "
"position estimates)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <copter:AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` = 2（默认值），使用 EKF2（本页编写时 EKF3 "
"尚不支持外部位置估计）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:170 e1202146624642c1abf8ce0c4a61c287
msgid ":ref:`EK2_ENABLE <copter:EK2_ENABLE>` = 1 (the default)"
msgstr ":ref:`EK2_ENABLE <copter:EK2_ENABLE>` = 1（默认值）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:171 6c642f043f594eb3b1867c73997c7a10
msgid ":ref:`EK3_ENABLE <copter:EK3_ENABLE>` = 0 (the default)"
msgstr ":ref:`EK3_ENABLE <copter:EK3_ENABLE>` = 0（默认值）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:172 ce6ba1ecffd348a09e08925df32ec808
msgid ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` = 0 to disable the GPS"
msgstr ":ref:`GPS1_TYPE <GPS1_TYPE>` = 0，禁用 GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:173 85494e11ce8a45ec845e1f74570743d5
msgid ""
":ref:`EK2_GPS_TYPE <copter:EK2_GPS_TYPE>` = 3 to disable the EKF's use of "
"the GPS"
msgstr ":ref:`EK2_GPS_TYPE <copter:EK2_GPS_TYPE>` = 3，禁止 EKF 使用 GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:174 2b3cda89ed454e37a42782d75fe9ec4a
msgid ""
":ref:`COMPASS_ENABLE<copter:COMPASS_ENABLE>` = 0, :ref:`COMPASS_USE "
"<copter:COMPASS_USE>` = 0, :ref:`COMPASS_USE2 <copter:COMPASS_USE2>` = 0, "
":ref:`COMPASS_USE3 <copter:COMPASS_USE3>` = 0 to disable the EKF's use of "
"the compass and instead rely on the heading from ROS and Hector SLAM"
msgstr ""
":ref:`COMPASS_ENABLE<copter:COMPASS_ENABLE>` = 0、:ref:`COMPASS_USE "
"<copter:COMPASS_USE>` = 0、:ref:`COMPASS_USE2 <copter:COMPASS_USE2>` = "
"0、:ref:`COMPASS_USE3 <copter:COMPASS_USE3>` = 0，禁止 EKF 使用罗盘，转而依赖 ROS 和 "
"Hector SLAM 提供的航向"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:176 c6c7bc8fd0e14c53931acac9212f1906
msgid "After changing any of the values above, reboot the flight controller."
msgstr "更改上述任意参数后，重启飞行控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:178 a4d26d252206426a976a830c77b003c5
msgid ""
"If all is working, vision position estimates should begin flowing in from "
"ROS to ArduPilot.  This can be confirmed by connecting to the flight "
"controller using the Mission Planner (or similar) and check the Flight Data "
"screen's Messages tab (bottom left) for messages from the EKF like below:"
msgstr ""
"若一切正常，视觉位置估计数据应开始从 ROS 流入 ArduPilot。可通过 Mission "
"Planner（或类似工具）连接飞行控制器，在飞行数据界面的「Messages」标签（左下角）中查看 EKF 的如下消息加以确认："

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:187 8a800a8982f44c94bb657275ca97f7a9
msgid ""
"Using the Mission Planner (or similar) go to the Flight Data screen and "
"right-mouse-button click on the map and select \"Set Home Here\" >> \"Set "
"EKF Origin\".  The vehicle should appear immediately on the map where you "
"clicked."
msgstr ""
"使用 Mission Planner（或类似工具）进入飞行数据界面，在地图上右键单击并选择「Set Home Here」>>「Set EKF "
"Origin」。飞行器应立即出现在您点击的地图位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:190 8d7efb3653104497ac07a6bd0bc8e44a
msgid "Video"
msgstr "视频"

#: ../../source/docs/ros-slam.rst:197 8b81930659ae48b2808c926959330fb2
msgid ""
"We are keen to improve ArduPilot's support of ROS so if you find issues "
"(such as commands that do not seem to be supported), please report them in "
"the `ArduPilot issues list "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ with a title that "
"includes \"ROS\" and we will attempt to resolve them as quickly as possible."
msgstr ""
"我们致力于改善 ArduPilot 对 ROS 的支持。若您发现问题（如某些命令似乎不被支持），请在 `ArduPilot 问题列表 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ 中以包含「ROS」的标题提交报告，我们将尽快处理。"
